ozumím."}, {"line": 6, "text": "Prosím, zopakuj to."}], "line_count": 6, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/cs-cz/unknown.dialog"}, "da-DK": {"entries": [{"line": 1, "text": "Beklager, jeg fik ikke fat i det."}, {"line": 2, "text": "Beklager, jeg forstår ikke."}, {"line": 3, "text": "Det forstår jeg ikke, men jeg lærer nyt hver dag."}, {"line": 4, "text": "Du må prøve at sige det på en anden måde."}, {"line": 5, "text": "Jeg beklager, men jeg forstår ikke."}, {"line": 6, "text": "Jeg er ikke sikker på jeg forstod dig."}, {"line": 7, "text": "Jeg forstår ikke."}, {"line": 8, "text": "Jeg ved ikke hvad det betyder."}, {"line": 9, "text": "Venligst omformulér din forespørgsel."}], "line_count": 9, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/da-dk/unknown.dialog"}, "de-DE": {"entries": [{"line": 1, "text": "Bitte formuliere deinen Befehl um."}, {"line": 2, "text": "Entschuldigung, dass habe ich nicht verstanden."}, {"line": 3, "text": "Entschuldigung, ich verstehe nicht."}, {"line": 4, "text": "Es tut mir leid, ich verstehe nicht."}, {"line": 5, "text": "Ich bin nicht sicher, ob ich dich verstanden habe."}, {"line": 6, "text": "Ich verstehe das nicht, aber ich lerne jeden Tag neue Dinge."}, {"line": 7, "text": "Ich verstehe nicht."}, {"line": 8, "text": "Ich weiß nicht, was das bedeutet."}, {"line": 9, "text": "Möglicherweise musst du das anders sagen."}], "line_count": 9, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/de-de/unknown.dialog"}, "en-US": {"entries": [{"line": 1, "text": "I don't know what that means."}, {"line": 2, "text": "I don't understand, but I'm learning new things everyday."}, {"line": 3, "text": "I don't understand."}, {"line": 4, "text": "I'm not sure I understood you."}, {"line": 5, "text": "I'm sorry, I don't understand."}, {"line": 6, "text": "Please rephrase your request."}, {"line": 7, "text": "Sorry, I didn't catch that."}, {"line": 8, "text": "Sorry, I don't understand."}, {"line": 9, "text": "You might have to say that a different way."}], "line_count": 9, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/en-us/unknown.dialog"}, "es-419": {"entries": [{"line": 1, "text": "Creo que no te sigo."}, {"line": 2, "text": "Disculpa, no lo entiendo."}, {"line": 3, "text": "Lo siento, no entiendo."}, {"line": 4, "text": "Lo siento, no lo he pillado."}, {"line": 5, "text": "No entiendo."}, {"line": 6, "text": "No lo entiendo, pero aprendo cosas nuevas cada día."}, {"line": 7, "text": "No sé qué significa eso."}, {"line": 8, "text": "Por favor reformula tu petición."}, {"line": 9, "text": "Tal vez tengas que decir eso de otra manera."}], "line_count": 9, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/es-lm/unknown.dialog"}, "es-ES": {"entries": [{"line": 1, "text": "Creo que no te sigo."}, {"line": 2, "text": "Disculpa, no lo entiendo."}, {"line": 3, "text": "Lo siento, no entiendo."}, {"line": 4, "text": "Lo siento, no lo he pillado."}, {"line": 5, "text": "No entiendo."}, {"line": 6, "text": "No lo entiendo, pero aprendo cosas nuevas cada día."}, {"line": 7, "text": "No sé qué significa eso."}, {"line": 8, "text": "Por favor reformula tu petición."}, {"line": 9, "text": "Tal vez tengas que decir eso de otra manera."}], "line_count": 9, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/es-es/unknown.dialog"}, "eu-ES": {"entries": [{"line": 1, "text": "Agian beste era batera esan behar duzu hori."}, {"line": 2, "text": "Barkatu. Ez dut harrapatu."}, {"line": 3, "text": "Barkatu. Ez dut ulertu."}, {"line": 4, "text": "Ez dakit zer esan nahi duen horrek."}, {"line": 5, "text": "Ez dut ulertu, baina egunero ari naiz gauza berriak ikasten."}, {"line": 6, "text": "Ez dut ulertu."}, {"line": 7, "text": "Ez nago ziur ulertu ote dizudan."}, {"line": 8, "text": "Mesedez, idatzi zure eskaera beste era batera."}, {"line": 9, "text": "Sentitzen dut. Ez dut ulertu."}], "line_count": 9, "slots": [], "validation": [], "file_path": "locale/eu-eu/unknown.dialog"}, "fa-IR": {"entries": [{"l